# The Moonlit Path (windurst 9): the Full Moon Fountain battlefield (scripts/battlefields/Full_Moon_Fountain/
# moonlit_path.lua: index 0, entry MS_Entrance, the Moon Bauble required and kept). Accepted with the bauble, at
# MS_Entrance the bauble opens the entry menu 32000; its update with option 1 (The Moonlit Path, index 0, arena 1)
# registers and enters; Fenrir Prime of arena 1 (FENRIR_PRIME) is killed, and the win's 32001 opens within the kill
# step. Its finish runs the battlefield's onEventFinishWin and this quest's handler (battlefieldWin 224, this
# battlefield's: the Moon Bauble taken, the Whisper of the Moon). The battlefield menu's record holder comes from the
# seeded per-run bcnm_records. The no-win arm (32001 with battlefieldWin not 224) is #battlefield_novar.
lists FullMoonFountain/MS_Entrance/onTrigger FullMoonFountain/onEventFinish/32001
char zone=FullMoonFountain pos=-301.3,9.5,-260.0 job=WAR lvl=75
quest Windurst.TheMoonlitPath accepted
keyitem MoonBauble
login
trigger MS_Entrance            # the bauble: the entry menu 32000
update 32000 option=1          # The Moonlit Path (index 0), arena 1: registered, entered (the bauble kept)
finish                         # in the arena
kill FENRIR_PRIME              # Fenrir Prime of arena 1: the battlefield won, 32001 opens
finish                         # battlefieldWin 224: the Moon Bauble taken, the Whisper of the Moon
